      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Checked if it's worth sumthin'...\r\nPah! Worthless!\r\nOnly Arisen want dis junk!\r\nJus' a stupid rock to us.",
        "Jp" : "価値ある物かと、調べたが――\r\nフン――どうでもいい！\r\n覚者にしか価値ないことがワカッタ！\r\nココにあっても、タダの石ころ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 650619,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 18,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Trade, huh?\r\nMaybe I let it go...\r\nBut if you want that rock,\r\nbetter ask real nice.",
        "Jp" : "おまえ、取引きするなら\r\n譲ってやってもいいが――\r\nあの石ころ欲しいなら、頼みを聞くんだナ"
